pspy
Usage: pspy

Watches processes and cron jobs start, live, without needing root. On a box you
have a foothold on, it is how you spot a privileged script or a scheduled task
you could turn into a way up -- local privilege-escalation enumeration.

	pspy                   watch everything (ctrl-c to stop)
	timeout N pspy         watch for N seconds, then stop

Run it on a machine you are authorised to be on.

See also: strace, ps
